It runs on gpt-5-mini in Microsoft Foundry, and every run is traced in Application Insights.

5
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:04,800
A Verifier checks every line in code: seventy lines, zero spoiler leaks, every number verified.

6
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:08,900
And fans can ask out loud, through Foundry Voice Live.

7
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:27,800
Its tools are locked to the fan's moment, on a Container Apps relay with a managed identity: no keys.

8
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:36,600
Every line is voiced by Azure Speech HD, in seven languages, and every push runs our tests, accessibility included.
